rectal cancer; FAP or FAPC=familial adenomatous polyposis coli.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote9"><label>a</label><p>Joint ovarian clinic for moderate risk ovarian/breast ovarian: min =&#x000a3;27.26, max =&#x000a3;51.44, mean = &#x000a3;39.35.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote10"><label>b</label><p>If the cancer-affected relative of a high-risk patient is too ill to attend the cancer genetics clinic, a genetic counsellor will make a home visit. A home visit would result in a mean net increase of &#x000a3;36.60 to the cost of testing a cancer-affected relative and the presymptomatic patient.</p></fn><fn id="tbfnote11"><label>c</label><p>Joint ovarian clinic for high-risk ovarian/breast ovarian: min =&#x000a3;36.75, max =&#x000a3;110.25, mean = &#x000a3;73.50.</p></fn></table-wrap-foot></table-wrap></floats-wrap></article>